  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Povo** (2 reviews): Karl Denson, Robert Walter and Big Sam all joined Soulive on stage for this tune [3][4]\n- **Liquid** (2 reviews): The Shady Horns and Nigel Hall accompanied the band on this number [3][4]\n- **Lenny** (2 reviews): Roosevelt Collier sat in with the band on this song [3][4]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Outrage**: back after 57 archived shows (986 days) [5]\n- **Povo**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 10 archived performances [5]\n- **Liquid**: back after 72 archived shows (1353 days) [5]\n- **Licking Stick**: back after 30 archived shows (391 days); rare: 7 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2012-01-13.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 10 songs; 106 min [1]\n- **soulive2012-01-13.flac16**: source not stated; 10 songs; 106 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2012-01-13.flac24**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: Schoeps mk4 (DIN, FOB/DFC 15' from stage) -> Sound Devices 744T -> WAV (@24/96); [1]\n- **soulive2012-01-13.flac16**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: Schoeps mk4 (DIN, FOB/DFC 15' from stage) -> Sound Devices 744T -> WAV (@24/96); [2]",
